---
args: { impacts: InterventionImpact[], interventions: RestorationIntervention[], experts: ExpertReviewScope[] }
returns: EcologicalIncidentReview
---
Link an adverse observation to the named intervention and area. Suspend only the implicated intervention, preserve the observation, and request a currently available expert whose scope covers the affected taxa or ecological system. Do not continue the intervention while the effect is unresolved.
